<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta
      name="viewport"
      content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
    />
    <title>Reminder: Tax Advocate Group Hiring Event</title>
    <style>
      body,
      table,
      td,
      p,
      a {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      body {
        background-color: #f4f6f9;
        font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      }
      img {
        border: 0;
        display: block;
        outline: none;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .email-wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #f4f6f9;
        padding: 30px 0;
      }
      .email-container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #fff;
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
      }
      .email-header {
        background-color: #1a2744;
        padding: 30px 40px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .email-header img {
        max-width: 200px;
        height: auto;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      .hero-banner {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a2744 0%, #2c4a7c 100%);
        padding: 28px 40px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .hero-banner h1 {
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.3;
        margin: 0;
      }
      .hero-banner p {
        color: #b8c9e0;
        font-size: 15px;
        margin-top: 8px;
      }
      .email-body {
        padding: 36px 40px;
        color: #333;
      }
      .email-body p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        color: #444;
      }
      .greeting {
        font-size: 17px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #1a2744;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      .highlight-box {
        background-color: #f0f5fb;
        border-left: 4px solid #2c4a7c;
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 20px 24px;
        margin: 24px 0;
      }
      .highlight-box p {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #333;
      }
      .highlight-box p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }
      .highlight-box strong {
        color: #1a2744;
      }
      .detail-label {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 78px;
        color: #6b829e;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .cta-wrapper {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 28px 0;
      }
      .cta-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #2c4a7c;
        color: #fff !important;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 14px 36px;
        border-radius: 6px;
      }
      .divider {
        border: none;
        border-top: 1px solid #e8ecf1;
        margin: 28px 0;
      }
      .email-footer {
        background-color: #1a2744;
        padding: 28px 40px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .email-footer p {
        color: #8fa3bf;
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }
      .email-footer a {
        color: #b8c9e0;
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
      .footer-phone {
        font-size: 16px !important;
        color: #fff !important;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        margin-bottom: 12px !important;
      }
      @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {
        .email-body,
        .email-header,
        .hero-banner,
        .email-footer {
          padding-left: 24px !important;
          padding-right: 24px !important;
        }
        .hero-banner h1 {
          font-size: 20px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
      <table
        class="email-container"
        role="presentation"
        cellpadding="0"
        cellspacing="0"
        width="100%"
      >
        <tr><td class="email-header"><img
              src="cid:emailLogo"
              alt="Tax Advocate Group"
            /></td></tr>
        <tr><td class="hero-banner"><h1>The Seminar is TOMORROW</h1><p
            >Sales careers at Tax Advocate Group</p></td></tr>
        <tr><td class="email-body">
            <p class="greeting">Hi {{name}},</p>
            <p>Make sure you show up on time and ready to learn about a career
              opportunity in the Tax Resolution space.</p>
            <div class="highlight-box">
              <p><span class="detail-label">When</span><strong>{{eventDate}} at {{eventTime}}</strong></p>
              <p><span class="detail-label">Where</span>{{addressLine1}}, {{addressCity}}</p>
              <p><span class="detail-label">Role</span>Sales representative &mdash; full-time, in-office</p>
            </div>
            <div class="cta-wrapper"><a
                href="{{ctaUrl}}"
                class="cta-button"
              >View Event Details &amp; RSVP</a></div>
            <p style="text-align:center;font-size:14px;color:#666;">Questions, or
              need to confirm your spot? Call
              <strong style="color:#1a2744;">{{rsvpPhone}}</strong>
              or email
              <a href="mailto:{{rsvpEmail}}" style="color:#2c4a7c;">{{rsvpEmail}}</a>.</p>
            <hr class="divider" />
            <p style="font-size:13px;color:#888;line-height:1.6;">You're
              receiving this reminder because you expressed interest in a career
              opportunity with Tax Advocate Group. If this reached you in error,
              please disregard it.</p>
          </td></tr>
        <tr><td class="email-footer">
            <p class="footer-phone">&#128222; {{rsvpPhone}}</p>
            <p><strong style="color:#fff;">Tax Advocate Group</strong></p>
            <p>{{addressLine1}}, {{addressCity}}</p>
            <p style="margin-top:10px;"><a
                href="https://www.taxadvocategroup.com"
              >taxadvocategroup.com</a></p>
            <p style="margin-top:12px;font-size:11px;color:#6b829e;">If you'd
              prefer not to receive these, you can
              <a href="<%asm_global_unsubscribe_url%>">unsubscribe here</a>.</p>
            <p style="margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:#6b829e;">&copy;
              {{year}}
              Tax Advocate Group. All rights reserved.</p>
          </td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
